# 🛍️ Polyglot Shop – Kubernetes + CI/CD

This repository contains the **Polyglot Retail Store Sample App** deployed on **Kubernetes** with full **CI/CD automation**.  
It is based on the AWS retail-store-sample-app, extended to run in a **production-like environment** using **EKS**, **ECR**, and **GitHub Actions**.

---

## 🚀 Features
- Microservices-based e-commerce sample app:
  - **Catalog** (Go + MariaDB)
  - **Orders** (Java Spring Boot + Postgres + RabbitMQ)
  - **Cart** (Node.js + DynamoDB Local)
  - **Checkout** (Python/Flask + Redis)
  - **UI** (React/Node.js frontend)
- Infrastructure services:
  - RabbitMQ
  - PostgreSQL
  - MariaDB
  - Redis
  - DynamoDB Local
- Kubernetes manifests included (`k8-manifests/`)
- One-click deploy script: `deploy.sh`
- CI/CD pipeline (GitHub Actions → EKS)

---

